        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Tinny Keeps the Tin Cup Challenge Going</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47025.webp" alt="Tinny Keeps the Tin Cup Challenge Going" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>[vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Keep Tinny Running!&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][ultimate_spacer height=&#8221;15&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>
<h4>Tinny puts the miles in <strong>year-round</strong> for Teton Valley&#8217;s nonprofit community. Keep Tinny nourished for the long haul with a <strong>direct donation</strong> to the <strong>Community Foundation of Teton Valley.</strong></h4>
<p>[/vc_column_text][dt_button link=&#8221;https://cfjh.iphiview.com/cfjh/DonorView/AccountInformation/tabid/495/dispatch/accountselection_id$10906_hash$1c0c71b9a8078a604dbdfa2c94b19b5566a479d2/Default.aspx&#8221; target_blank=&#8221;true&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; size=&#8221;medium&#8221; bg_color_style=&#8221;custom&#8221; bg_color=&#8221;#992020&#8243;]Donate Today![/dt_button][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7685&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7686&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Logistics&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>In the deep winter months, Tinny researches shirt colors, Event Day vendors, inventory, permits, menu items, logistics, celebration venues, and more.</p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7687&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Vetting&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>As Spring rolls around, Tinny reviews Tin Cup applicants &amp; their qualifications to assure donors that their gifts to any of <strong>47 nonprofits</strong> will be put to good use.</p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7688&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Mailing&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>Upon acceptance, Tinny quickly creates, prints, orchestrates and distributes an all-inclusive brochure to every box holder in the county &#8211; <strong>5,774!</strong></p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7689&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Distribution&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>Once the <strong>8-week Giving Period</strong> opens, Tinny is on the move distributing Tin Cup brochures, posters, and banners all around Teton Valley and beyond.</p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7690&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Event Day Prep&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>From coordinating Tin Cup captains and volunteers, to on-the-ground layout, marketing, and race registration, Tinny ensures that our community celebrates a successful Event Day.</p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7691&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Day to Day&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>In addition to making a daily run to the post office to pick up Tin Cup donations, Tinny also fields calls and questions from nonprofits and community members alike.</p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7692&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Gift Processing&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>During the Giving Period, the Foundation processes 100% of the gifts received via mail, credit card, our office, or at the Farmer&#8217;s Market. Last year we processed gifts from over <strong>1,000 individual donors.</strong></p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7693&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Farmer&#8217;s Market&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>On Friday&#8217;s, during the Giving Period, you can find Tinny and company at the Driggs Farmer&#8217;s Market &#8211; accepting donations, distributing T-shirts, and registering runners.</p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7697&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Event Day&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>Tinny comes alive on Event Day! Tinny loves celebrating our amazing community by running alongside those that make it all happen &#8211; donors, volunteers, and nonprofits. Seeing everyone together fills his cup.</p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7696&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Nonprofit Awards Party &amp; Match&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>After the dust settles and ALL gifts have been processed, Tinny sets the <strong>Matching Grant</strong> allocation and celebrates by distributing checks to participating nonprofits at the Awards Party.</p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7698&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Challenger Fund&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>Tinny keeps the Community Foundation&#8217;s illustrious Board working hard to raise funds for the whole nonprofit community. In 11 years, Tinny has grown our number of Challengers from <strong>33 to 185!</strong></p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7699&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Programs&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>Tinny keeps the programs funded by the Challenger Fund running year-round. This includes <strong>Youth Philanthropy, Competitive Grants,</strong> and <strong>Nonprofit Board &amp; Staff Workshops.</strong></p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;2/3&#8243;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Community Counts!&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221;][ultimate_spacer height=&#8221;15&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>
<p>Tinny trains year-round to make Event Day and the 8-week Giving Period come off without a hitch. Additionally, while always keeping Tin Cup in mind, Tinny continues to offer <strong>additional programming</strong> while managing <strong>funds</strong>, <strong>scholarships</strong>, <strong>nonprofit networking opportunities</strong>, <strong>equipment rentals</strong>, and <strong>best practices</strong> for nonprofit staff and board members. Consider a <strong>direct gift</strong> to the <strong>Community Foundation</strong> to support Tinny&#8217;s unwavering efforts to elevate our nonprofit community and the people, wildlife, and landscape within Teton Valley.</p>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7695&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][dt_button link=&#8221;https://cfjh.iphiview.com/cfjh/DonorView/AccountInformation/tabid/495/dispatch/accountselection_id$10906_hash$1c0c71b9a8078a604dbdfa2c94b19b5566a479d2/Default.aspx&#8221; target_blank=&#8221;true&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; size=&#8221;medium&#8221; bg_color_style=&#8221;custom&#8221; bg_color=&#8221;#992020&#8243;]Donate Today![/dt_button][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>
